description	"Renegade Squadron: Wookie

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (1)
- DLT-18 Heavy Blaster Rifle (2)
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Strength (3)
- Fast Fury Regen

^3Abilities:
- Fury (3) ^3[CS1 Melee]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS2 Melee]

The Renegade Squadron was a Rebel Alliance military unit of pirates, smugglers, and other types of fringers assembled and commanded by Col Serra at Han Solo's request. The unit consisted of underworlders recruited by Serra from around the galaxy."